# RUNG cost oracle — x86_64 (Skylake-class core, AVX2 vectors (WP21 stage B))
# lat = latency cycles (representative), thr = reciprocal throughput.
# cliff 1 = no reasonable implementation on this target; the verifier's
# target gate rejects modules using cliff ops for this target.
vl 8
op add.i lat 1 thr 1
op sub.i lat 1 thr 1
op mul.i lat 3 thr 1
op udiv.i lat 26 thr 10
op sdiv.i lat 26 thr 10
op urem.i lat 26 thr 10
op srem.i lat 26 thr 10
